  lines:
  - leftSpeaker: 0
    speakerName: Vega
    text: "I received your call Glorp sorry for being late, I\u2019m stepping in!
      Seems like you\u2019re almost done with the Metalheads anyways. You can be
      proud of yourself, recruit !"
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: "Don't be so full of yourself ! You guys haven\u2019t won yet, just wait
      for what\u2019s coming to you\u2026\r\n"
  - leftSpeaker: 0
    speakerName: Vega
    text: "C\u2019mon now ! Make them eat those words, Cadet! May the Groove be with
      you !\r\n\n\n"
